2024-08-01 15:13:43,965 - INFO - Updated journal_filename session:0CY0fTqtdHo: [{'result': [{'category': 'Livestream', 'channel_title': 'Active Inference Institute', 'description': 'Second participatory group discussion on the paper\n\n"The neural coding framework for learning generative models" \nAlexander Ororbia & Daniel Kifer (2022) \nhttps://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-022-29632-7 \n\n"Convolutional Neural Generative Coding: Scaling Predictive Coding to Natural Images" \nAlexander Ororbia, Ankur Mali (2023) \nhttps://arxiv.org/abs/2211.12047 \n\n"Spiking neural predictive coding for continually learning from data streams" \nAlexander Ororbia (2023) \nhttps://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0925231223004150 \n\n"CogNGen: Constructing the Kernel of a Hyperdimensional Predictive Processing Cognitive Architecture" \nAlexander Ororbia, M. Alex Kelly (2023) \nhttps://escholarship.org/uc/item/35j3v2kh\n\nhttps://arxiv.org/abs/2311.09589\n[Submitted on 16 Nov 2023]\nMortal Computation: A Foundation for Biomimetic Intelligence\nAlexander Ororbia, Karl Friston\nThis review motivates and synthesizes research efforts in neuroscience-inspired artificial intelligence and biomimetic computing in terms of mortal computation. Specifically, we characterize the notion of mortality by recasting ideas in biophysics, cybernetics, and cognitive science in terms of a theoretical foundation for sentient behavior. We frame the mortal computation thesis through the Markov blanket formalism and the circular causality entailed by inference, learning, and selection. The ensuing framework -- underwritten by the free energy principle -- could prove useful for guiding the construction of unconventional connectionist computational systems, neuromorphic intelligence, and chimeric agents, including sentient organoids, which stand to revolutionize the long-term future of embodied, enactive artificial intelligence and cognition research.\n\nActive Inference Institute information: \nWebsite: https://activeinference.org/ \nTwitter: https://twitter.com/InferenceActive \nDiscord: https://discord.gg/8VNKNp4jtx \nYouTube: https://www.youtube.com/c/ActiveInference/ \nActive Inference Livestreams: https://coda.io/@active-inference-institute/livestreams', 'episode': '2', 'filename': 'youtube_0CY0fTqtdHo.mp4', 'id': 'session:0CY0fTqtdHo', 'journal_filename': 'LiveStream_056.2_youtube_0CY0fTqtdHo.txt', 'published_at': '2023-11-22T07:46:40Z', 'series': 'LiveStream_056', 'session_name': '0CY0fTqtdHo', 'thumbnails': 'https://i.ytimg.com/vi/0CY0fTqtdHo/mqdefault.jpg', 'title': 'Active Inference LiveStream 056.2 Neural Generative Coding, Active Inference, and Mortal Computation', 'transcribed': True, 'url': 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0CY0fTqtdHo', 'wav_extracted': True}], 'status': 'OK', 'time': '3.64895ms'}]
