2024-08-02 11:39:23,936 - INFO - Updated journal_filename session:TubYmyvsynA: [{'result': [{'category': 'GuestStream', 'channel_title': 'Active Inference Institute', 'description': 'Kristen Whittle\n"Reflections and implications of a naïve attitude to architecture"\nThis proposed title is purposefully mischievous in that it derives from the SCHILLER/JUNGIAN sense of the word as it applies to ‘architect as nature’ and ‘communicating an intimate form of nature in architecture’. This would expand a conversation about the embedding of coherence (as it relates to free energy and active inference) into a sophisticated form of designed salutogenesis for architecture and cities and would enable me to encapsulate a number of thematics of past architectural projects I have designed including the new Australian Embassy in Washington DC.\n\nhttps://studiokristenwhittle.com/\nhttps://www.instagram.com/studiokristenwhittle/\nhttps://au.linkedin.com/company/studio-kristen-whittle\n\nActive Inference Institute information: \nWebsite: https://activeinference.org/ \nTwitter: https://twitter.com/InferenceActive \nDiscord: https://discord.gg/8VNKNp4jtx \nYouTube: https://www.youtube.com/c/ActiveInference/ \nActive Inference Livestreams: https://coda.io/@active-inference-institute/livestreams', 'episode': '1', 'filename': 'youtube_TubYmyvsynA.mp4', 'id': 'session:TubYmyvsynA', 'journal_filename': 'GuestStream_060.1_youtube_TubYmyvsynA.simple.txt', 'published_at': '2023-10-19T13:20:07Z', 'series': 'GuestStream_060', 'session_name': 'TubYmyvsynA', 'thumbnails': 'https://i.ytimg.com/vi/TubYmyvsynA/mqdefault.jpg', 'title': 'ActInf GuestStream 060.1 ~ "Reflections and implications of a naïve attitude to architecture"', 'transcribed': True, 'url': 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TubYmyvsynA', 'wav_extracted': True}], 'status': 'OK', 'time': '3.510111ms'}]
