2024-08-03 09:40:52,777 - INFO - Updated journal_filename session:SerC9wYOMHs: [{'result': [{'category': 'OrgStream', 'channel_title': 'Active Inference Institute', 'description': 'd20 is a Discord bot that allows communities to experience how communication and governance interact in an LLM-mediated environment. Communicate: d20 moderates the group\'s governance communication through different "culture modules" - playfully modifying users\' messages to cultivate diverse interaction environments for participants. Interact: Groups can come together to embark on a governance “quest”, where they make lightweight decisions about the their group and experience varied mechanisms of decision-making.\nThe team working on this project will give a presentation on the background of the project, overview the development process, conduct short interactive demos, and explore practical applications and complementary research questions.\nWebsite: https://metagov.github.io/d20-governance/\n\nGuest:\nCent Hosten\nJanita Chalam\nHazel\n\nActive Inference Institute information: \nWebsite: https://activeinference.org/ \nTwitter: https://twitter.com/InferenceActive \nDiscord: https://discord.gg/8VNKNp4jtx \nYouTube: https://www.youtube.com/c/ActiveInference/ \nActive Inference Livestreams: https://coda.io/@active-inference-institute/livestreams', 'episode': '1', 'filename': 'youtube_SerC9wYOMHs.mp4', 'id': 'session:SerC9wYOMHs', 'journal_filename': 'OrgStream_006.1_youtube_SerC9wYOMHs.simple.txt', 'published_at': '2024-01-23T13:01:27Z', 'series': 'OrgStream_006', 'session_name': 'SerC9wYOMHs', 'thumbnails': 'https://i.ytimg.com/vi/SerC9wYOMHs/mqdefault.jpg', 'title': 'ActInf OrgStream 006.1 ~ d20 Governance: an experimental governance environment', 'transcribed': True, 'url': 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SerC9wYOMHs', 'wav_extracted': True}], 'status': 'OK', 'time': '7.186377ms'}]
