nd experimentally supported substrate for implementing conscious active inference in brains.\n\nActive Inference Institute information: \nWebsite: https://www.activeinference.institute/\nActivities: https://activities.activeinference.institute/ \nDiscord: https://discord.activeinference.institute/\nDonate: http://donate.activeinference.institute/\nYouTube: https://www.youtube.com/c/ActiveInference/ \nX: https://x.com/InferenceActive \nActive Inference Livestreams: https://video.activeinference.institute/', 'episode': '1', 'filename': 'FeD_L8oOhIk.wav', 'from_coda_json': True, 'github': '', 'guests': 'Mike Wiest', 'id': RecordID(table_name=session, record_id=hoj0jfaqp4zo4wu5qg9r), 'is_private': False, 'other_participants': 'Daniel Friedman', 'paper_link': '', 'published_at': '2025-09-24T04:53:58Z', 'scheduled_date': datetime.datetime(2025, 9, 23, 7, 0, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), 'series': 'GuestStream_121', 'session_name': 'FeD_L8oOhIk', 'slides_url': '', 'thumbnails': 'https://i.ytimg.com/vi/FeD_L8oOhIk/mqdefault.jpg', 'title': 'ActInf GuestStream 121.1 ~ Conscious active inference (Wiest and Puniani)', 'transcribed': True, 'url': 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FeD_L8oOhIk', 'wav_extracted': True}]
