2025-10-01 08:08:30,622 - INFO - Transcription and update complete for session  session:k7r8voc37u8wjr8ku61o: [{'category': 'TextbookGroup/ParrPezzuloFriston2022/Cohort_7', 'channel_title': 'Active Inference Institute', 'description': 'Full playlist for Cohort 7 textbook group\nhttps://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLNm0u2n1Iwdpx8_PMXvrxOuUlRnm7QX3c\n\nMore information on the Parr et al. 2022 textbook group at the Institute https://textbook-group.activeinference.institute/\n\nAll Active Inference Institute livestreams and videos: \nhttps://video.activeinference.institute/\n\nActive Inference: The Free Energy Principle in Mind, Brain, and Behavior\nBy Thomas Parr, Giovanni Pezzulo and Karl J. Friston\nhttps://mitpress.mit.edu/9780262045353/active-inference/ https://www.activeinference.org/', 'filename': 'M3r2AMBFZBo.wav', 'from_coda_json': True, 'github': '', 'guests': '', 'id': RecordID(table_name=session, record_id=k7r8voc37u8wjr8ku61o), 'is_private': False, 'other_participants': '', 'paper_link': '', 'published_at': '2025-04-24T16:41:33Z', 'scheduled_date': datetime.datetime(2024, 8, 26, 7, 0, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), 'series': 'Meeting_007', 'session_name': 'M3r2AMBFZBo', 'slides_url': '', 'thumbnails': 'https://i.ytimg.com/vi/M3r2AMBFZBo/mqdefault.jpg', 'title': 'ActInf Textbook Group ~ Cohort 7 ~ Session 6 (Chapter 3) ~ 8/26/2024', 'transcribed': True, 'url': 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=M3r2AMBFZBo', 'wav_extracted': True}]
