2025-10-01 11:21:10,220 - INFO - Updated session in database: [{'category': 'GuestStream', 'channel_title': 'Active Inference Institute', 'description': 'ActInf GuestStream #096.1\nRon Itelman: "Cognitive Experience Design (CXD): Designing AI Systems for Trust"\n\nA fundamental challenge in active inference is observing and verifying beliefs when designing intelligent systems composed of human and machine learners.This talk presents an approach that makes AI decision-making processes transparent and verifiable, similar to how git makes code changes visible. \n\nAs protocols for integrating LLMs with applications emerge (e.g., Anthropic\'s Model-Context-Protocol), we now have opportunities to combine deterministic and probabilistic components in a control systems approach. By introducing a clear design framework for capturing and verifying both human and AI intent, this talk introduces how to enable continuous, real-time belief updating with clear lineage. \n\nThrough practical examples and reference implementations, this talk shows how to create feedback mechanisms that capture problem-solving processes and enable real-time recommendations for knowledge and decision-making.\n\nActive Inference Institute information: \nWebsite: https://activeinference.institute/ \nX: https://x.com/InferenceActive\nDiscord: https://discord.activeinference.institute/\nDonate: https://donate.activeinference.institute/\nYouTube: https://www.youtube.com/c/ActiveInference/ \nActive Inference Livestreams: https://video.activeinference.institute/', 'episode': '1', 'filename': 'kCmC4i-drEY.wav', 'from_coda_json': True, 'github': '', 'guests': 'Ron Itelman', 'id': RecordID(table_name=session, record_id=s7j4r78tfax6wwaf8uty), 'is_private': False, 'other_participants': 'Daniel Friedman', 'paper_link': '', 'published_at': '2025-01-18T10:18:25Z', 'scheduled_date': datetime.datetime(2025, 1, 17, 8, 0, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), 'series': 'GuestStream_096', 'session_name': 'kCmC4i-drEY', 'slides_url': '', 'thumbnails': 'https://i.ytimg.com/vi/kCmC4i-drEY/mqdefault.jpg', 'title': 'ActInf GuestStream: Ron Itelman: Cognitive Experience Design (CXD): Designing AI Systems for Trust', 'transcribed': False, 'url': 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kCmC4i-drEY', 'wav_extracted': True}]
