2025-10-01 14:20:01,249 - INFO - Updated session in database: [{'category': 'Insights', 'channel_title': 'Active Inference Institute', 'description': 'In this episode of Active Inference Insights, we welcome our first mathematician onto the show: Lance Da Costa. If you’re into Langevins, Fokker-Plancks, solenoidals and Fisher information metric tensors, this one is for you. However, if all that terrifies you to high heaven, don’t fret; Lance and Darius also explore eco-niche modelling, temporality, metacognition and far more in this deep dive into cutting-edge Active Inference theory. \n\nLance Da Costa\nhttps://www.lancelotdacosta.com\nhttps://scholar.google.com/citations?user=PCHqHCsAAAAJ&hl=en\nhttps://twitter.com/lancelotdacosta?lang=en\n\nDarius Parvizi-Wayne\nhttps://twitter.com/dparviziwayne\nhttps://www.researchgate.net/profile/Darius-Parvizi-Wayne\n\nActive Inference Insititute\nhttps://www.activeinference.org\nhttps://twitter.com/InferenceActive', 'episode': None, 'filename': 'kLLMB91DMPA.wav', 'from_coda_csv': True, 'github': '', 'guests': 'Lancelot Da Costa', 'id': RecordID(table_name=session, record_id=0t0yee4qrxjvtrgkiw2i), 'other_participants': 'Darius Parvizi-Wayne', 'published_at': datetime.datetime(2024, 2, 8, 16, 0, 10, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), 'scheduled_date': datetime.datetime(2024, 2, 8, 8, 0, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), 'series': 'Insights_010', 'session_name': 'kLLMB91DMPA', 'slides_url': '', 'thumbnails': 'https://i.ytimg.com/vi/kLLMB91DMPA/mqdefault.jpg', 'title': 'Lance Da Costa ~ Active Inference Insights 010 ~ Mathematics, Time, Selfhood', 'transcribed': False, 'url': 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kLLMB91DMPA', 'wav_extracted': True}]
