2025-10-01 22:36:56,996 - INFO - Updated session in database: [{'category': 'Insights', 'channel_title': 'Active Inference Institute', 'description': 'You may, at some point during this episode, find yourself self-modelling about your self-model’s ability to model itself in a self-modelled way. If so, sorry. Today’s episode is, indeed, all about selfhood, as well as other phenomenal states, such as the minimal phenomenal experience and AI awareness, as Darius is joined by philosopher and cognitive scientist, Wanja Wiese.\n\nWanja Wiese\nhttps://homepage.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/wanja.wiese/\nhttps://scholar.google.de/citations?user=utjW3csAAAAJ&hl=de\nhttps://twitter.com/wawiese?lang=en\n\nDarius Parvizi-Wayne\nhttps://twitter.com/dparviziwayne\nhttps://www.researchgate.net/profile/Darius-Parvizi-Wayne\n\nActive Inference Insititute\nhttps://www.activeinference.org\nhttps://twitter.com/InferenceActive', 'episode': None, 'filename': 'uO1QgxI9B3g.wav', 'from_coda_csv': True, 'github': '', 'guests': 'Wanja Wiese', 'id': RecordID(table_name=session, record_id=o34qggc0ab2pfapbugln), 'other_participants': 'Darius Parvizi-Wayne', 'published_at': datetime.datetime(2024, 3, 21, 14, 0, 7, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), 'scheduled_date': datetime.datetime(2024, 3, 21, 8, 0, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), 'series': 'Insights_016', 'session_name': 'uO1QgxI9B3g', 'slides_url': '', 'thumbnails': 'https://i.ytimg.com/vi/uO1QgxI9B3g/mqdefault.jpg', 'title': 'Wanja Wiese ~ Active Inference Insights 016 ~ Consciousness, Information Geometry, Ethical AI', 'transcribed': False, 'url': 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uO1QgxI9B3g', 'wav_extracted': True}]
