2025-10-13 15:59:52,121 - INFO - Updated metadata_filename and github URL for session:ex90hjkw7xqv1ynr3sxw: [{'category': 'ModelStream', 'channel_title': 'Active Inference Institute', 'description': "Witness the power of message passing as we guide you through the process of building a drone in real-time using our toolbox RxInfer.jl. Whether you're a novice intrigued by neuroscience or a seasoned researcher, this immersive demonstration promises to unveil the practical applications of active inference, revolutionizing our approach to autonomous systems.\n\nhttps://github.com/ReactiveBayes/RxInfer.jl\nhttps://rxinfer.ml/\nhttps://lazydynamics.com/\n\n----\n\nActive Inference Institute information: \nWebsite: https://activeinference.org/ \nTwitter: https://twitter.com/InferenceActive \nDiscord: https://discord.gg/8VNKNp4jtx \nYouTube: https://www.youtube.com/c/ActiveInference/ \nActive Inference Livestreams: https://coda.io/@active-inference-institute/livestreams", 'episode': '1', 'filename': 'TZNXs5jP9hE.wav', 'from_coda_csv': True, 'github': 'https://github.com/ActiveInferenceInstitute/ActiveInferenceJournal/tree/main/ModelStream/ModelStream_010', 'guests': 'Bart van Erp,Albert Podusenko', 'id': RecordID(table_name=session, record_id=ex90hjkw7xqv1ynr3sxw), 'metadata_filename': 'ModelStream_010.1_TZNXs5jP9hE.simple.txt', 'other_participants': 'Daniel Friedman', 'published_at': datetime.datetime(2024, 4, 5, 1, 24, 27, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), 'scheduled_date': datetime.datetime(2024, 4, 4, 8, 0, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), 'series': 'ModelStream_010', 'session_name': 'TZNXs5jP9hE', 'slides_url': '', 'thumbnails': 'https://i.ytimg.com/vi/TZNXs5jP9hE/mqdefault.jpg', 'title': 'ActInf ModelStream 010.1 ~ Building a Drone with RxInfer.jl ~ Bart van Erp, Albert Podusenko', 'transcribed': True, 'transcript_method': 'WhisperX', 'url': 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TZNXs5jP9hE', 'wav_extracted': True}]
