2025-10-18 15:30:57,168 - INFO - Updated metadata_filename and github URL for session:kg1sf35ryezd4yuzarik: [{'category': 'GuestStream', 'channel_title': 'Active Inference Institute', 'description': "Simon Wardley is the creator of Wardley Mapping, an open-source collaborative strategic mapping technique that has gained viral adoption in the business and technology communities. At its core, it creates space to eloquently capture collective intelligence.\n\nWardley Mapping helps groups and organizations develop situational awareness by visually representing patterns and trends in the evolution of technologies, capabilities, and user needs within a competitive landscape. His pioneering work on Wardley Mapping has been influential in understanding complex, evolving systems by applying core principles of pattern recognition and strategic adaptation. It offers a practice of exploring collective intelligence, and how landscapes are shaped beyond theory and speculation.\n\nWe’ll explore his experiences, insights and surprises as a global trendsetter facilitating hundreds of diverse groups working on a wide range of topics, including the future of education, work, and technology. \n\nSimon's work captures mega-trends that reveal how market forces shape divergence and consensus that manifest in powerful, unusual and fascinating ways.  \n\nLearn more.. \nhttps://medium.com/wardleymaps/on-being-lost-2ef5f05eb1ec\nhttps://learnwardleymapping.com/book/\nhttps://www.linkedin.com/in/simonwardley/\nhttps://github.com/wardley-maps-community/awesome-wardley-maps \n\nActive Inference Institute information: \nWebsite: https://activeinference.org/ \nTwitter: https://twitter.com/InferenceActive \nDiscord: https://discord.gg/8VNKNp4jtx \nYouTube: https://www.youtube.com/c/ActiveInference/ \nActive Inference Livestreams: https://coda.io/@active-inference-institute/livestreams", 'episode': '1', 'filename': '15n6WN9jGrY.wav', 'from_coda_csv': True, 'github': 'https://github.com/ActiveInferenceInstitute/ActiveInferenceJournal/tree/main/GuestStream/GuestStream_083', 'guests': 'Simon Wardley ', 'id': RecordID(table_name=session, record_id=kg1sf35ryezd4yuzarik), 'metadata_filename': 'GuestStream_083.1_15n6WN9jGrY.simple.txt', 'other_participants': 'Susan Hasty,Daniel Friedman', 'published_at': datetime.datetime(2024, 5, 11, 6, 50, 53, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), 'scheduled_date': datetime.datetime(2024, 5, 10, 8, 0, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), 'series': 'GuestStream_083', 'session_name': '15n6WN9jGrY', 'slides_url': '', 'thumbnails': 'https://i.ytimg.com/vi/15n6WN9jGrY/mqdefault.jpg', 'title': 'ActInf GuestStream 083.1 ~ Simon Wardley', 'transcribed': True, 'transcript_method': 'WhisperX', 'url': 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=15n6WN9jGrY', 'wav_extracted': True}]
