2025-10-18 15:44:21,211 - INFO - Updated metadata_filename and github URL for session:rk6q64r5nw4pf5ds32gq: [{'category': 'Insights', 'channel_title': 'Active Inference Institute', 'description': 'In this fourth episode of Active Inference Insights, Darius and Inês Hipólito delve into the murky waters of Markov blankets, exploring whether they are real or just an instrumental tool, how they impact on The Modularity of Mind theory, as well as the true meanings of “active” and “sensory” states. In addition to this, Inês presents a thorough account of the historical transition from computational to enactivist theories of cognition, before she and Darius try and shed light on the role of consciousness and representations in a mind that is putatively embodied, embedded, enactive and extended beyond the brain.\n\nInês Hipólito \nhttps://ineshipolito.my.canva.site/\nhttps://twitter.com/ineshipolito?\nhttps://scholar.google.com/citations?user=WXSE96YAAAAJ&hl=en\n\nDarius Parvizi-Wayne\nhttps://twitter.com/dparviziwayne\n\nActive Inference Insititute\nhttps://www.activeinference.org\nhttps://twitter.com/InferenceActive', 'episode': None, 'filename': 'cKZIJQLhudk.wav', 'from_coda_csv': True, 'github': 'https://github.com/ActiveInferenceInstitute/ActiveInferenceJournal/tree/main/Insights/Insights_004', 'guests': 'Inês Hipólito', 'id': RecordID(table_name=session, record_id=rk6q64r5nw4pf5ds32gq), 'metadata_filename': 'Insights_004_cKZIJQLhudk.simple.txt', 'other_participants': 'Darius Parvizi-Wayne', 'published_at': datetime.datetime(2023, 12, 14, 17, 0, 8, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), 'scheduled_date': datetime.datetime(2023, 12, 14, 8, 0, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), 'series': 'Insights_004', 'session_name': 'cKZIJQLhudk', 'slides_url': '', 'thumbnails': 'https://i.ytimg.com/vi/cKZIJQLhudk/mqdefault.jpg', 'title': 'Inês Hipólito ~ Active Inference Insights 004 ~ Markov Blankets, Modularity, Enactivism', 'transcribed': True, 'transcript_method': 'WhisperX', 'url': 'https:/