2025-10-18 15:44:21,216 - INFO - Updated metadata_filename and github URL for session:vo35ub3vm38rj11xr21e: [{'category': 'Insights', 'channel_title': 'Active Inference Institute', 'description': 'In this lively and self-aware interview, Darius Parvizi-Wayne reflects on his podcast series "Active Inference Insights." We\'ll dive into the wonders of active inference, exploring how it helps us decode cognitive ecosystems and make sense of decision-making. Parvizi-Wayne shares the joys and challenges of turning dense theories into engaging discussions, revealing the podcast\'s success in making high-level concepts accessible. Expect some laughs as we unpack the series\' impact on the research community, its knack for sparking interdisciplinary conversations, and its vision for the future. Join us for a fun yet insightful journey through the mind-expanding world of active inference.\n\nDarius Parvizi-Wayne\nhttps://scholar.google.com/citations?user=ahuMDH4AAAAJ&hl=en\nhttps://x.com/dparviziwayne\n\nActive Inference Institute information: \nWebsite: https://activeinference.org/ \nTwitter: https://twitter.com/InferenceActive \nDiscord: https://discord.activeinference.institute/\nYouTube: https://www.youtube.com/c/ActiveInference/ \nActive Inference Livestreams: https://video.activeinference.institute/', 'episode': None, 'filename': '1Xu8jYKWsGM.wav', 'from_coda_csv': True, 'github': 'https://github.com/ActiveInferenceInstitute/ActiveInferenceJournal/tree/main/Insights/Insights_024', 'guests': 'Darius Parvizi-Wayne', 'id': RecordID(table_name=session, record_id=vo35ub3vm38rj11xr21e), 'metadata_filename': 'Insights_024_1Xu8jYKWsGM.simple.txt', 'other_participants': 'Daniel Friedman', 'published_at': datetime.datetime(2024, 7, 9, 5, 5, 24, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), 'scheduled_date': datetime.datetime(2024, 7, 8, 8, 0, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), 'series': 'Insights_024', 'session_name': '1Xu8jYKWsGM', 'slides_url': '', 'thumbnails': 'https://i.ytimg.com/vi/1Xu8jYKWsGM/mqdefault.jpg', 'title': 'Active Inference Insights 024 ~ Darius Parvizi-Wayne (Season Finale // Reflection)', 'transcribed': True, 'transcript_method': 'WhisperX', 'url': 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1Xu8jYKWsGM', 'wav_extracted': True}]
