2025-10-18 15:44:21,233 - INFO - Updated metadata_filename and github URL for session:zc3pefz8z6kgbrg6lvyx: [{'category': 'Insights', 'channel_title': 'Active Inference Institute', 'description': 'There is no better person to outline the fundamental philosophical implications of the Free Energy Principle than today’s guest: Kathryn Nave. Tune in to hear about Kathryn’s new book on active inference, as well as her conceptions of agency, the self, interiority, exteriority and much more. She and Darius also discuss visual phenomenology and why percepts can be ultimately described as intermediary. \n\nKathryn Nave\nhttps://www.ed.ac.uk/profile/kate-nave\nhttps://twitter.com/KathrynNave\nhttps://www.dialecticalsystems.eu/author/kate_nave/\n\nDarius Parvizi-Wayne\nhttps://twitter.com/dparviziwayne\nhttps://www.researchgate.net/profile/Darius-Parvizi-Wayne\n\nActive Inference Insititute\nhttps://www.activeinference.org\nhttps://twitter.com/InferenceActive', 'episode': None, 'filename': '2hLeKUdOUrg.wav', 'from_coda_csv': True, 'github': 'https://github.com/ActiveInferenceInstitute/ActiveInferenceJournal/tree/main/Insights/Insights_020', 'guests': 'Kathryn Nave', 'id': RecordID(table_name=session, record_id=zc3pefz8z6kgbrg6lvyx), 'metadata_filename': 'Insights_020_2hLeKUdOUrg.simple.txt', 'other_participants': 'Darius Parvizi-Wayne', 'published_at': datetime.datetime(2024, 4, 18, 15, 0, 6, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), 'scheduled_date': datetime.datetime(2024, 4, 18, 8, 0, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), 'series': 'Insights_020', 'session_name': '2hLeKUdOUrg', 'slides_url': '', 'thumbnails': 'https://i.ytimg.com/vi/2hLeKUdOUrg/mqdefault.jpg', 'title': 'Kathryn Nave  ~ Active Inference Insights 020 ~ Agency, Vision, Life', 'transcribed': True, 'transcript_method': 'WhisperX', 'url': 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2hLeKUdOUrg', 'wav_extracted': True}]
