2025-10-18 15:57:24,535 - INFO - Updated metadata_filename and github URL for session:0hz74mg8p92w8folxd2t: [{'category': 'OrgStream', 'channel_title': 'Active Inference Institute', 'description': 'Jamie Joyce & John Ash\n"Harnessing Collective Intelligence to Map AI Debates"\n\nThe Society Library is a nonprofit organization dedicated to enabling more free and informed decisions by saving users thousands of research hours surfacing collective societal intelligence and modeling data as a deliberation so we can see from different points of view on complex issues. We have worked with Universities, local governments, activist organizations, fact-checkers, and general members of the public to create services, products, and educational content to serve this mission.\nWebsite: http://SocietyLibrary.com\n\nTo read more about our AI Debate Maps: \nhttps://societylibrary.org/topics-blog/ai-alignment-superintelligence-ethics\n\nActive Inference Institute information: \nWebsite: https://activeinference.org/ \nTwitter: https://twitter.com/InferenceActive \nDiscord: https://discord.gg/8VNKNp4jtx \nYouTube: https://www.youtube.com/c/ActiveInference/ \nActive Inference Livestreams: https://coda.io/@active-inference-institute/livestreams', 'episode': '1', 'filename': 'cPv4TVBFANc.wav', 'from_coda_csv': True, 'github': 'https://github.com/ActiveInferenceInstitute/ActiveInferenceJournal/tree/main/OrgStream/OrgStream_007', 'guests': 'Jamie Joyce,John Ash', 'id': RecordID(table_name=session, record_id=0hz74mg8p92w8folxd2t), 'metadata_filename': 'OrgStream_007.1_cPv4TVBFANc.simple.txt', 'other_participants': 'Daniel Friedman', 'published_at': datetime.datetime(2024, 3, 21, 8, 33, 30, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), 'scheduled_date': datetime.datetime(2024, 3, 20, 8, 0, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc), 'series': 'OrgStream_007', 'session_name': 'cPv4TVBFANc', 'slides_url': '', 'thumbnails': 'https://i.ytimg.com/vi/cPv4TVBFANc/mqdefault.jpg', 'title': 'ActInf OrgStream 007.1 ~ Jamie Joyce, J